{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105340","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210534001:1":{"text":"역시... 신밧드... 도망갔어요. 믿어서는 안 되는 거였는데!","source_cn":"辛巴达果然跑了，就知道不能相信他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F01C374A37ADE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210534002:1":{"text":"쫓을 필요 없어. 신밧드는 도망친 게 아니라 테시오를 쫓으러 간 거야.","source_cn":"不用追，他不是逃跑，而是去追泰西欧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B6E31FD6F4FCEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210534003:1":{"text":"왜 테시오를 쫓으러 간 거죠? 그 둘이 무슨 원한이라도 있는 건가요...?","source_cn":"为什么他要追泰西欧？他们有仇还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F25791FA510EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210534004:1":{"text":"요점만 얘기한다면, 있어.","source_cn":"长话短说：有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A096E8BB8607EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210534005:1":{"text":"아버지에 대한 원한이.","source_cn":"而且是父仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106755AA3CBECA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210534006:1":{"text":"네? 그런 얘기는 들어본 적이 없는데...","source_cn":"哎？从没听他提起过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768BAC019754174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210534007:1":{"text":"말하자면 복잡해. 나중에 직접 물어봐. 우선 놓치지 않게 쫓아가자.","source_cn":"这事比较复杂，你们以后问他吧，我们先追，别跟丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0611877208BC64D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}